 The host adapter lives in `rtx_numos*.cpp/.h`. [Enhanced sky options](RemixNumosAPI.md) and
 [the renderer notes](../documentation/NumosSky.md) describe the option namespace and the frame order.
+
+## Enhanced camera sun rays (2026-11-26)
+
+The NUMOS post-depth hook in `rtx_numos.cpp` runs `rtx_fork_numos_rays`. Only the Enhanced composite binds its
+two extra slots and applies the filled ray image to a true camera miss. `src/dxvk/meson.build` lists the pass
+and `test_enhanced_sky.cpp` checks the option names, skip policy and quality selection.
